[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-silhouette@4da5046883246533fd9d015a70e87c1f10e51840/docs/img/pool.jpg[/img][/center]

[center][size=4][b]OBody NG's body distribution, for Fallout 4. Every NPC gets a body of their own the first time you meet them, and keeps it: an ordinary one most often, an unflattering one less often, a conventionally beautiful one rarely. The Commonwealth's named people each have their own.[/b][/size][/center]

[center]
[url=https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/d206cec39a5dab0f8141732a6e7b1917f856a138d7a28ea2241bd27f205bdd0d][img]https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FReidenXerx%2Ffo4-silhouette%2Fmaster%2Fdocs%2Fvt-badge.json&style=for-the-badge&labelColor=2b2b2b&logo=virustotal&logoColor=white[/img][/url] [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-silhouette/blob/master/LICENSE][img]https://img.shields.io/github/license/ReidenXerx/fo4-silhouette?color=blue&style=for-the-badge&labelColor=2b2b2b[/img][/url] [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-silhouette][img]https://img.shields.io/badge/source-GitHub-181717?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=2b2b2b&logo=github&logoColor=white[/img][/url] [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-silhouette/commits][img]https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/ReidenXerx/fo4-silhouette?label=last%20commit&style=for-the-badge&labelColor=2b2b2b[/img][/url]
